{"write":["lib.v3","// Copyright 2026 Someone.\n\n// Counts <b>things</b>; see [the docs](command:x).\n//\n//   - one\n//   - two\ncomponent Lib {\n\t// The count, after `def`.\n\tdef count = 1;\n\tdef plain = 2;\n}\n"]}
{"write":["main.v3","component Main {\n\tdef main() -> int { return Lib.count + Lib.plain; }\n}\n"]}
